It's intuitive.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.260
Just do it until it feels right.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:46.498
Do it until it feels right
but if it feels wrong,

00:10:46.498 --> 00:10:49.380
it could feel very wrong and
even when it feels right,

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.400
it feels wrong because
