can be in control of this.

00:11:26.794 --> 00:11:27.627
Own it.
It's weird.

00:11:27.627 --> 00:11:28.730
It's a weird feeling.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.060
It's not that the feeling goes away,

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.630
