and it had been many years

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:37.070
so it was very fresh to me, it was like,

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:41.100
I felt like I was fillin'
up my whole brain cavity

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.570
with salt water 'cause you mix
in that salt water solution.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:45.680
Yeah.
And nothing's coming out

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.940
the other side so I'm like ooh,

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:50.850
and it's just half the
pot's going up my nose,

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.375
nothing coming out and I'm
like where is this going?

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:54.208
You're blocked.
Is it gonna come

00:11:54.208 --> 00:11:55.470
up my ear?
You're blocked.

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:58.970
And I started hearing a
weird thing in my ear.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:01.550
It started to burn a little bit,

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.850
but it felt like--
It's all connected.

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:07.852
