00:12:07.852 --> 00:12:10.460
And it's just, yeah, you feel
like you're drowning yourself

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.660
via one nostril.
That's weird,

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.980
'cause all that happens to
me when I'm super stuffed,

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:17.020
I can feel it trying to
go into the other side,

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.890
